{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17537","headline":"和河南罗主簿送校书兄归江南 · 权德舆","name":"和河南罗主簿送校书兄归江南","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"兄弟泣殊方，天涯指故乡。\n断云无定处，归鴈不成行。\n草莽人烟少，风波水驿长。\n上虞亲渤澥，东楚隔潇湘。\n古戍阴传火，寒芜晓带霜。\n海门潮灩灩，沙岸荻苍苍。\n京辇辞芸阁，衡方忆草堂。\n知君始宁隐，还缉旧荷裳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17537.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17537","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}